# Root build context, shared by backend/Dockerfile and js-service/Dockerfile.
#
# node_modules must never be copied in: pnpm's store layout is full of absolute
# symlinks into the host's store, so a copied tree is both wrong inside the image
# and refuses to be replaced (`ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY`).
# Build outputs are excluded for the same reason a stale one is worse than none.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store

# Nothing here affects an image, and copying it only invalidates layer caches.
.git
**/.DS_Store
docs/evidence
*.log
